WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:18.855
go outside and watch Maggie's riding lesson," Henry suggested.

2
00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:22.016
"Someone might do something suspicious."

3
00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:28.199
"Okay. Maybe you should bring Maggie's sandals so they don't get stolen," Cole said.

4
00:00:29.219 --> 00:00:31.200
Henry was pretty sure Cole was joking.

5
00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:33.856
But he picked up the sandals anyway.

6
00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:36.877
"That's a good idea," he said.

7
00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:42.239
"If these sandals disappear, Maggie's parents will freak out."

8
00:00:43.339 --> 00:00:43.999
Cole nodded.

9
00:00:44.019 --> 00:00:46.960
"I think Maggie said the riding ring is this way."

10
00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.241
He headed toward the back door.

11
00:00:52.482 --> 00:00:54.862
On their way out, the boys passed Jill.

12
00:00:55.862 --> 00:00:58.283
She was trying to yank a wheelbarrow out of a stall.

13
00:00:59.263 --> 00:01:01.144
It was piled high with horse manure.

14
00:01:02.336 --> 00:01:05.898
"Ugh!" Jill cried as the wheelbarrow almost tipped over.

15
00:01:05.918 --> 00:01:08.560
Then she spotted the boys.

16
00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.221
"Hey," she said.

17
00:01:11.241 --> 00:01:13.122
"Will you two help me?

18
00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:15.163
My wheelbarrow is stuck."

19
00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:18.965
"Sure." Henry put down the sandals.

20
00:01:19.966 --> 00:01:21.667
Then he and Cole grabbed the wheelbarrow.

21
00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:25.169
Working together, they soon pulled it into the aisle.

22
00:01:25.189 --> 00:01:27.410
"Whew! Thanks."

23
00:01:28.551 --> 00:01:30.352
Jill wiped sweat off her forehead.

24
00:01:31.392 --> 00:01:32.893
"I thought I'd never get it out of there."

25
00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.877
"Cleaning all these stalls must be hard work," Henry said.

26
00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.579
"It is."

27
00:01:40.079 --> 00:01:40.719
Jill frowned.

28
00:01:40.739 --> 00:01:42.241
"And Ms.

29
00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:43.742
Wood doesn't pay me very much."

30
00:01:43.762 --> 00:01:45.943
"So why do you do it?"

31
00:01:46.184 --> 00:01:46.944
Cole asked.

32
00:01:46.964 --> 00:01:51.007
"Because it's the only way to pay for extra riding lessons."

33
00:01:52.128 --> 00:01:52.729
Jill sighed.

34
00:01:52.749 --> 00:01:56.552
"I wish I had a way to earn more cash!

35
00:01:57.752 --> 00:02:01.593
Then I could ride every day and not have to clean a bunch of stinky stalls first."

36
00:02:03.134 --> 00:02:05.994
Henry and Cole said good-bye to Jill and headed outdoors.

37
00:02:13.036 --> 00:02:14.377
you thinking what I'm thinking?"

38
00:02:15.437 --> 00:02:18.698
Cole asked as they sat down on a bench outside the riding ring.

39
00:02:19.858 --> 00:02:22.899
"Yes, if you're thinking that Jill should be a suspect."

40
00:02:23.979 --> 00:02:25.900
Henry put Maggie's sandals on the bench.

41
00:02:27.008 --> 00:02:30.369
"It sounds like she'd do anything to get more money for riding."

42
00:02:30.389 --> 00:02:33.271
"Including steal stuff?"

43
00:02:33.631 --> 00:02:34.371
Cole asked.

44
00:02:35.472 --> 00:02:36.072
"Who knows?"

45
00:02:36.512 --> 00:02:37.132
Henry said.

46
00:02:37.152 --> 00:02:41.674
"She could probably sell Maggie's gloves and charm bracelet.

47
00:02:42.735 --> 00:02:45.096
And she might have thought she could cash that check."

48
00:02:45.116 --> 00:02:49.037
"Okay, we'll put her on the suspect list," Cole said.

49
00:02:49.057 --> 00:02:52.599
"But we'd better not let her know she's on there.

50
00:02:53.999 --> 00:02:57.372
If she turns out to be innocent again, she'll be really annoyed!"

51
00:02:58.453 --> 00:02:59.253
Henry laughed.

52
00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:04.694
The Lemonade Detectives had suspected Jill of stealing during their very first mystery.

53
00:03:05.775 --> 00:03:07.655
She'd turned out to be innocent in that case.

54
00:03:08.696 --> 00:03:10.756
But that didn't mean she was innocent now too.

55
00:03:12.176 --> 00:03:13.697
Henry glanced at the riding ring.

56
00:03:13.717 --> 00:03:16.778
"We should be watching our other suspects."

57
00:03:17.918 --> 00:03:20.059
He and Cole watched the lesson for a while.

58
00:03:21.159 --> 00:03:24.500
Ms. Wood stood in the middle of the ring and told the riders what to do.

59
00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:28.989
First she had them walk their horses around in a big circle.

60
00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.750
Then she told them to trot.

61
00:03:32.791 --> 00:03:36.532
Henry noticed that trotting was faster, and it looked kind of bouncy.

62
00:03:36.552 --> 00:03:38.853
"This is no fun!"

63
00:03:39.253 --> 00:03:40.594
Zach complained loudly.

64
00:03:40.614 --> 00:03:44.556
"Every time my pony trots, I almost fall off."

65
00:03:44.576 --> 00:03:48.097
"That kid really doesn't want to be here, does he?"

66
00:03:48.377 --> 00:03:49.257
Cole whispered.

67
00:03:49.277 --> 00:03:51.859
"It's easy, Zach!"

68
00:03:52.179 --> 00:03:53.179
Daisy called out.

69
00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.100
"Just watch me."

70
00:03:56.240 --> 00:04:00.082
As Daisy trotted past the others, Eleanor's pony slowed to a walk.

71
00:04:01.202 --> 00:04:04.043
"Ms. Wood, my pony is lazy!"

72
00:04:04.463 --> 00:04:05.404
Eleanor called out.

73
00:04:05.424 --> 00:04:10.686
"I have to squeeze him so often, my leg muscles are tired!"

74
00:04:10.706 --> 00:04:13.687
"You're doing fine, Eleanor," Ms.

75
00:04:13.767 --> 00:04:14.387
Wood said.

76
00:04:14.407 --> 00:04:17.509
"Daisy, please come back and join the others."

77
00:04:17.529 --> 00:04:22.391
"But I was just showing Zach how to trot," Daisy said.

78
00:04:22.411 --> 00:04:25.132
"I was doing it right, wasn't I?"

79
00:04:26.188 --> 00:04:29.389
"Daisy is pretty competitive," Cole whispered to Henry.

80
00:04:29.409 --> 00:04:32.151
"She tried out for the swim team, remember?"

81
00:04:33.271 --> 00:04:34.072
Henry nodded.

82
00:04:34.092 --> 00:04:37.893
"Maybe she's afraid Maggie is a better rider.

83
00:04:39.294 --> 00:04:43.676
Daisy could be taking Maggie's stuff so Maggie will get in trouble and have to quit."

84
00:04:44.676 --> 00:04:47.037
"Zach has a good motive too," Cole said.

85
00:04:47.057 --> 00:04:49.338
"He hates this place.

86
00:04:50.459 --> 00:04:52.840
Maybe he's stealing stuff just to cause trouble."

87
00:04:53.816 --> 00:04:57.518
"Or he could be trying to get his sister in trouble," Henry said.

88
00:04:57.538 --> 00:05:03.060
"If she gets fired, his parents probably wouldn't make him ride anymore."

89
00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:05.521
Cole looked out at the ring again.

90
00:05:06.681 --> 00:05:09.823
Eleanor was still whining about her pony being too slow.

91
00:05:09.843 --> 00:05:11.843
"What about Eleanor?"

92
00:05:12.164 --> 00:05:12.624
he said.

93
00:05:12.644 --> 00:05:16.145
"She's the only one who doesn't seem to have a motive.

94
00:05:17.666 --> 00:05:22.328
Maybe she thought that jingling Maggie's charm bracelet at her pony would make him go faster."

95
00:05:23.372 --> 00:05:24.132
Henry laughed.

96
00:05:26.513 --> 00:05:27.393
"I doubt that.

97
00:05:28.514 --> 00:05:31.494
We don't know Eleanor very well," he reminded Cole.

98
00:05:32.655 --> 00:05:35.215
"Maybe she has a motive that we haven't figured out yet."

99
00:05:36.596 --> 00:05:37.296
Cole nodded.

100
00:05:37.316 --> 00:05:41.517
"All we know is that she's kind of lazy and she has a dog."

101
00:05:42.658 --> 00:05:44.618
"Speaking of her dog, there he is."

102
00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.739
Henry saw Little Spot wandering toward them.

103
00:05:48.739 --> 00:05:50.960
The dog stopped to sniff at something on the ground.

104
00:05:52.044 --> 00:05:53.085
Then he came toward them.

105
00:05:53.105 --> 00:05:55.227
"Here, Little Spot."

106
00:05:56.188 --> 00:05:57.329
Cole held out his hand.

107
00:05:58.329 --> 00:05:59.430
Little Spot ignored him.

108
00:06:00.511 --> 00:06:02.753
He grabbed one of Maggie's sandals and took off!

109
00:06:02.773 --> 00:06:05.515
"Hey!" Henry cried.

110
00:06:05.535 --> 00:06:08.018
"Aha!" Cole said.

111
00:06:08.038 --> 00:06:10.600
"I think we just caught the thief!"
